%% MCP tool call flow — for Marp (export with mermaid-cli)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant You
    participant Host as Claude Desktop (MCP Host)
    participant LLM
    participant MCP as MCP Server (e.g. gitlab)
    participant Ext as External System (e.g. GitLab API)

    You->>Host: "List my open merge requests"
    Host->>LLM: prompt + list of available tools
    LLM-->>Host: "call tool list_merge_requests"
    Host->>MCP: invoke list_merge_requests(...)
    MCP->>Ext: HTTPS request with your token
    Ext-->>MCP: JSON response
    MCP-->>Host: structured tool result
    Host->>LLM: prompt + tool result
    LLM-->>Host: final answer
    Host-->>You: "You have 3 open MRs: …"
